{"kind": "mod", "id": 774, "name": "Battle for Dormitory", "slug": "battle-for-dormitory", "teaser": "How about a dynamic, juicy, and delicious shootout in the dormitory ?", "owner_name": "Local Crew", "downloads": 3880, "favourites": 0, "featured": false, "contains_ads": false, "contains_ai_content": false, "cheat_notice": false, "license_name": "The Unlicense", "guid": null, "thumbnail_local": "thumbs/1041.jpg", "category": null, "category_id": null, "updated_at": "2026-07-07T16:58:43.000000Z", "created_at": "2023-03-01T00:02:19.000000Z", "published_at": "2023-03-01T00:02:19.000000Z", "latest_constraint": "~3.9.0", "latest_version": "1.0.3", "has_local": false, "has_github": false, "license_link": "https://choosealicense.com/licenses/unlicense/", "description_html": "<p><strong>How about a dynamic, juicy, and delicious shootout in the dormitory ?</strong></p>\n<p>Ha ? There <strong>aren’t many bots</strong> spawning there, are there?</p>\n<p>Not anymore, son…</p>\n<p><strong>Installing</strong>:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>move <strong>Dormitory</strong> folder to <strong>user/mods</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Dormitory mod</strong>:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Concentrates the spawn points in the open zone selected in the configuration file [ <strong>/cfg/cfg.json</strong> ].</li>\n<li>Changes the loot in the selected zone to the most valuable that is in the game.</li>\n<li>Makes some changes to the number of bots.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>It is now possible to change several locations at once, through a configuration file.</strong></p>\n<p><strong>exam: This entry in the config will change customs and wood</strong></p>\n<p><strong><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://i.imgur.com/B7a3M0F.png\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/B7a3M0F.png\" alt=\"B7a3M0F.png\" /></a></strong></p>\n<p>**good_loot also moved to the configuration file</p>\n<p>exam:**</p>\n<p><strong><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://i.imgur.com/DiQFWER.png\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/DiQFWER.png\" alt=\"DiQFWER.png\" /></a></strong></p>\n<p><strong>To make the firefights even more interesting, I recommend installing <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/878-simple-wave-ai-generator-swag/?highlight=swag\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">SWAG</a>.</strong></p>\n<h2>Many thx to <strong>Kobrakon</strong>, without whom the existence of the mod would be impossible.</h2>\n", "versions": [{"version": "1.0.3", "spt_version_constraint": "~3.9.0", "content_length": null, "downloads": 1046, "published_at": "2024-05-10T17:24:11.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/774/battle-for-dormitory/1.0.3", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "unknown", "dependencies": []}], "repos": [], "source_code_links": [{"url": "https://drive.google.com/file/d/1KOVkGrXR5mGeNkRGuREeG7CNLHZkVxZY/view?usp=sharing", "label": ""}], "required_by": 0, "no_repo": true, "obtainable": false, "dep_problems": 0}